{"id": "34504", "title": "情狂独眼龙", "author": "陈毓华", "category": "文学名著", "count": 44, "available": 0, "cover": "", "status": "已完成", "source": "files/article/info/34/34504.htm", "intro": "她只是想学点防身术好混进黑社会做研究,没想到道馆竟是黑帮老大的地盘,这厢功夫学不成,那厢连生活都遭到威胁,殊不知大哥的严加控管只因对她动了心,只是她活灵活现的双眼怎生模糊得连帅哥本色也看不清,单纯的脑袋瓜塞不下爱情这小小玩意,小妮子却准备问鼎诺贝尔奖？！要不是那一场意外,她恐怕永远也无法挪出她的心去思考「人家」对她的好,只是,只是,只是－－这茅塞顿开几乎要付出生命的代价……", "base": "files/article/html/34/34504", "chapters": [{"title": "序言", "file": "2189028.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第1页", "file": "2189029.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第2页", "file": "2189030.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第3页", "file": "2189031.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第4页", "file": "2189032.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第5页", "file": "2189033.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第6页", "file": "2189034.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第7页", "file": "2189035.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第8页", "file": "2189036.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第9页", "file": "2189037.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第10页", "file": "2189038.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第11页", "file": "2189039.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第12页", "file": "2189040.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第13页", "file": "2189041.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第14页", "file": "2189042.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第15页", "file": "2189043.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第16页", "file": "2189044.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第17页", "file": "2189045.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第18页", "file": "2189046.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第19页", "file": "2189047.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第20页", "file": "2189048.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第21页", "file": "2189049.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第22页", "file": "2189050.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第23页", "file": "2189051.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第24页", "file": "2189052.html", "available": false}, {"title"